#created by Duel Circuit - Gateway Gwen (Six Samurai, 2010)
#era 2010
#tier Alley headliner, the Basement Game's reserve (docs/dev/HEADLINERS-2026-11-01.md)
#about Three Gateway of the Six go up first; every Six Samurai summoned after that pays two counters to each, and the counters search the next one. Kageki brings Kagemusha, Kizan joins, and Legendary Six Samurai - Shi En comes down with a Gateway's worth of counters to spare.
#why Gateway of the Six was limited in March 2011 and has been Forbidden since; under the March 2010 list it was legal at three, the swarm the Six Samurai were known for.
#source Built from Format Library deck 26873 (decks/history/six-samurai.ydk, YCSCHA11): two more Gateway of the Six for Dark Hole and Monster Reborn (Forbidden in March 2010), a second Enishi for the second Mystical Space Typhoon
